# OpenONT traffic bucket contract (single source of truth)
# Format: id|name|color
# Packet mark: bits 16..23 hold id  (OPENONT_DPI_MARK_SHIFT=16, MASK=0x00FF0000)
# Consumers: openont-dpi, openont-statsd, LuCI overview (via generated artifacts)
#
0|unknown|#7f8c8d
1|http|#0088cc
2|video|#e74c3c
3|game|#9b59b6
4|download|#27ae60
5|file|#16a085
6|im|#3498db
7|common|#95a5a6
8|other_app|#f39c12
9|speedtest|#e67e22
